  // game itself uses for its own wide opening (game.js's coastMesh()) — placed in the 3D scene from her real
  // course, not a flat photo pasted over the sea. `coastCloseHide` widens/narrows how far into the close-in
  // zoom the coast + Corbière stay visible before fading (they'd look wrong/oversized pressed right up close).
  // `islands` (the stylised vector outline below) now defaults off — the real plate does that job better; kept
